  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Podcasts for Media Plurality: Building a cornerstone of independent media in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results of the Project are as follows:
- To produce a range of podcast content on topics of interest to our target audience, including investigative journalism, social sciences, and economics.
- To develop a marketing plan that engages and expands our audience, increasing the reach of SOWT Originals.
- To build internal capacity for sustainability, including financial stability, technical capacity, and team development.
The content production will include: 
Ahraz podcast, new season (5 episodes): investigates real crimes and reveals their circumstances.
Manbet podcast (10 episodes): is an informative narrative podcast that tells interesting stories from the fields of humanities and social sciences.
Harrer podcast (15 episodes): was created to reflect on the media cycle by focusing on interviews with significant personalities in the media. To showcase the role of media.
A new economic focused show (10 episodes): to create honest, well-researched content about the state of the economy.
The project targets all governorates in Jordan and aims to have a diverse and inclusive audience to reach more people.</narrative>
  </description>
